string_coreModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Core string access over data-section literals.
    Provides: sir_const_str(ptr, ln) -> out String view over guest memory.
    Provides: sir_str_len(s) -> out Length.
    Provides: sir_str_concat(a, b) -> out Concatenation.
    Provides: sir_str_sub(s, start, len) -> out Substring.
    Provides: sir_str_idx(s, ch) -> out First index of char.
    Provides: sir_str_join_parts(parts) -> out Joins a string list.
    Provides: sir_str_trim(s) -> out Trims whitespace.
    Provides: sir_str_split(s, delim) -> out Splits on delimiter.
    Provides: sir_str_lt(a, b) -> out Lexicographic less-than.
    Provides: sir_split_first_line(src) -> out Head line.
